      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Are you crazy! I put three rounds from my Desert Eagle into it, and it# didn't even flinch!",
      "source_text": "Are you crazy! I put three rounds from my Desert Eagle into it, and it\n# didn't even flinch!",
      "source_line_start": 40,
